  "caveats": [
    "The affine structure of the trace in the weighted shift is an algebraic identity (exactly one factor of the word carries d) and was verified numerically at the deuteron to 1.8e-71 in PR #6309. It is not re-verified here; what is measured here is each nucleus's own coefficient, which is the part that does not transfer.",
    "This prices the colour-blindness; it does not say which arm is canonical. Whether the p-n interface carries the flavour weighting is a physical modelling choice (bean qou-fv0s)."
